I'll settle things with the guy!

00:12:43.529 --> 00:12:46.408
Don't! You going out there will
only complicate the issue!

00:12:46.432 --> 00:12:47.542
What?!

00:12:47.566 --> 00:12:49.578
You couldn't do your job,

00:12:49.602 --> 00:12:51.146
so I'm saying I'll rescue them
instead of you!

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.447
Hey, Ran! Calm down!

00:12:52.471 --> 00:12:55.617
How the hell can I stay calm?!
Sayo and Masato were kidnapped!

00:12:55.641 --> 00:12:56.017
KIDNAPPED!

00:12:56.041 --> 00:12:56.218
I'm telling you, that's not true!
KIDNAPPED!

00:12:56.242 --> 00:12:57.319
Talk about loud! I'm telling
you, that's not true! KIDNAPPED!

00:12:57.343 --> 00:12:57.673
Talk about loud!

00:12:58.043 --> 00:13:01.308
Be quiet! I can't concentrate
on my driving!

00:13:03.415 --> 00:13:05.227
Hey, the suspect's car!

00:13:05.251 --> 00:13:07.015
Mom, do a U-turn!

00:13:08.721 --> 00:13:11.190
Take that! I lost them
good and proper!

00:13:12.725 --> 00:13:14.215
What?!

00:13:16.061 --> 00:13:18.340
My nickname is the Odaiba Shark.

00:13:18.364 --> 00:13:20.776
| never let my prey get away,
once I've set my sights on it.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.177
Damn it!

00:13:22.201 --> 00:13:23.545
Hey, stop!

00:13:23.569 --> 00:13:25.264
What a stupid drama.

00:13:25.671 --> 00:13:28.550
Mister, why did you suddenly
make a U-turn?

00:13:28.574 --> 00:13:32.220
What's wrong, datchu? What about
meeting with your daughter?

00:13:32.244 --> 00:13:34.838
| just can't go now.

00:13:35.781 --> 00:13:37.579
Mister...

00:13:40.753 --> 00:13:43.765
Damn that kidnapper! Where'd he go?!

00:13:43.789 --> 00:13:45.985
I'm telling you, he's not a kidnapper.

00:13:49.295 --> 00:13:50.672
Oh, man!

00:13:50.696 --> 00:13:52.596
It's a dead end.

00:13:54.133 --> 00:13:54.876
What is it, Bro?!

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:56.868
Over there! That parked car!

00:14:00.406 --> 00:14:04.719
The engine's still warm.
They should still be nearby.

00:14:04.743 --> 00:14:06.221
Damn it!

00:14:06.245 --> 00:14:08.490
It's so unlucky for us to
run out of gas, ch...

00:14:08.514 --> 00:14:11.259
You really aren't a planner,
are you, Mister?

00:14:11.283 --> 00:14:12.828
I'm sorry.

00:14:12.852 --> 00:14:16.379
More importantly, how long are you
going to keep following me?

00:14:17.189 --> 00:14:18.834
And...

00:14:18.858 --> 00:14:21.259
why am I carrying you on my shoulders?

00:14:21.794 --> 00:14:24.388
Because... Because Sayo...

00:14:27.499 --> 00:14:29.144
| know.

00:14:29.168 --> 00:14:31.136
| have already resigned myself to it.

00:14:31.937 --> 00:14:33.481
Let's go back to the police box.

00:14:33.505 --> 00:14:35.917
But isn't your daughter
waiting for you?

00:14:35.941 --> 00:14:37.619
That's right!

00:14:37.643 --> 00:14:39.372
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:14:43.082 --> 00:14:44.726
"Daddy!"

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:48.778
That's what she'd say.
Sayo used to be so cute.

00:14:49.255 --> 00:14:53.401
Lately, she only uses that adorable
tone when she wants something.

00:14:53.425 --> 00:14:56.656
| hope she's not causing
trouble for Yamato.

00:15:00.799 --> 00:15:04.713
What a surprise. It's exactly at the
same spot as fifteen years ago.

00:15:04.737 --> 00:15:07.916
So, you always used to eat ice cream
with your daughter, datchu?

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:11.899
Yes, the day care center she
used to attend is close by.

00:15:12.311 --> 00:15:14.256
My wife would always come home late,

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:16.374
so it was my job to pick her up.

00:15:16.982 --> 00:15:19.679
Everyday, I'd carry her on my
shoulders like this and...

00:15:27.059 --> 00:15:28.493
The time you're supposed
to meet her...

00:15:29.161 --> 00:15:30.872
What time is it at, datchu?

00:15:30.896 --> 00:15:32.974
We said 5 o'clock.

00:15:32.998 --> 00:15:37.245
But that's something I just
decided on my own.

00:15:37.269 --> 00:15:39.447
Your daughter said she
would come, right?

00:15:39.471 --> 00:15:41.439
She said she has work,
so she wasn't sure.

00:15:41.874 --> 00:15:43.685
So, it doesn't matter anymore.

00:15:43.709 --> 00:15:44.819
Why?

00:15:44.843 --> 00:15:47.322
As I said, I'll go back to
the police box and...

00:15:47.346 --> 00:15:49.791
You can do that after you've met
with your daughter, datchu.

00:15:49.815 --> 00:15:52.477
The policeman will wait long enough
for you to do that, ch...

00:15:53.118 --> 00:15:54.496
But...

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:57.251
What are you going to do if your
daughter is waiting for you, datchu?

00:15:57.923 --> 00:16:01.484
But how can I face her
after what I've done?!

00:16:03.462 --> 00:16:07.909
Why?! You can't! You have to go!

00:16:07.933 --> 00:16:10.011
You're the one who asked her to
meet with you, right, Mister?!

00:16:10.035 --> 00:16:11.846
And you're going to break
your promise?!

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.838
Your daughter will be sad
to have a dad like that!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.117
That's...

00:16:16.141 --> 00:16:17.152
Oh, Ran!

00:16:17.176 --> 00:16:18.075
What's the matter?!

00:16:25.684 --> 00:16:27.209
My promise...

00:16:29.555 --> 00:16:31.633
Miss, what about your father?

00:16:31.657 --> 00:16:35.236
Oh, he's super-healthy
and a workaholic!

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.472
And he's a scold-aholic
at home, datchu!

00:16:37.496 --> 00:16:39.624
He's always yelling at me
for something!

00:16:40.799 --> 00:16:43.545
That's because he cares
about you, Miss.

00:16:43.569 --> 00:16:46.436
What? I don't know
about that, datchu.

00:16:47.806 --> 00:16:49.296
My promise...

00:16:50.309 --> 00:16:52.954
| should keep my promise,
shouldn't 1?

00:16:52.978 --> 00:16:54.055
Mister!

00:16:54.079 --> 00:16:56.047
Yes, that's exactly right!

00:16:57.883 --> 00:16:59.282
Well, shall we go then?

00:17:01.086 --> 00:17:04.432
Honestly! What is up with
my daughters?!

00:17:04.456 --> 00:17:06.701
They have no understanding
of how hard Mother works

00:17:06.725 --> 00:17:08.659
to balance her career and housework.

00:17:11.597 --> 00:17:15.443
Ran, you didn't run off because
you found where Sayo went...

00:17:15.467 --> 00:17:17.879
Nope, it's because I smelled
something tasty.

00:17:17.903 --> 00:17:20.600
Besides, you can't fight on
an empty stomach, right?

00:17:21.907 --> 00:17:24.103
Hey, I found out where Sayo
and Masato have gone.

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:26.944
They were apparently talking
about getting on a bus!

00:17:33.952 --> 00:17:35.716
Sayo!

00:17:40.959 --> 00:17:42.120
Sayo...

00:17:52.037 --> 00:17:54.282
| guess she isn't coming after all.

00:17:54.306 --> 00:17:56.551
Don't say that, it's still
too early to tell.

00:17:56.575 --> 00:17:58.420
That's right, datchu!

00:17:58.444 --> 00:18:01.573
Sanae isn't the kind of girl
who gets to places late.

00:18:02.381 --> 00:18:06.875
Back in elementary school, Sanae
would be at this bench everyday.

00:18:08.153 --> 00:18:11.123
She would be waiting for my return.

00:18:11.757 --> 00:18:15.318
No matter how late I was,
she was always here.

00:18:18.297 --> 00:18:22.777
| started my company the year my
daughter started middle school

00:18:22.801 --> 00:18:24.895
and we stopped going home
together after that.

00:18:25.571 --> 00:18:27.938
Since then, we've grown out of touch.

00:18:30.075 --> 00:18:31.653
Even today...

00:18:31.677 --> 00:18:34.339
| went to a general store, thinking
to buy her a present.

00:18:35.147 --> 00:18:38.879
But I got nostalgic and just
had to buy this water gun.

00:18:39.685 --> 00:18:43.622
I'm a full grown adult,
and I go and buy a toy.

00:18:47.359 --> 00:18:48.656
Sayo!

00:18:51.864 --> 00:18:53.074
Mister!

00:18:53.098 --> 00:18:54.008
Hey!

00:18:54.032 --> 00:18:58.379
You've got some guts kidnapping the
daughter of a family of policemen!

00:18:58.403 --> 00:18:59.881
Kidnapping?

00:18:59.905 --> 00:19:02.183
Prepare yourself, you kidnapper!

00:19:02.207 --> 00:19:03.641
No!

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:08.923
You're mean, Sis! He hasn't
done anything wrong!

00:19:08.947 --> 00:19:11.025
But he kidnapped you...

00:19:11.049 --> 00:19:13.061
Like I've been telling you,
he didn't kidnap them,

00:19:13.085 --> 00:19:15.816
Sayo and Masato just tagged
along on their own.

00:19:16.855 --> 00:19:20.368
Sheesh, you two never listened
to what I was saying.

00:19:20.392 --> 00:19:21.536
Yamato!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.670
Bro!

00:19:22.694 --> 00:19:23.972
If that's the case...

00:19:23.996 --> 00:19:25.807
Hurry up and say sol

00:19:25.831 --> 00:19:28.610
You're the ones that decided
to jump to a conclusion!

00:19:28.634 --> 00:19:31.296
No, it's entirely my fault.

00:19:33.105 --> 00:19:37.218
Officer Kotobuki, I am sorry for
the trouble I caused you.

00:19:37.242 --> 00:19:38.386
Mister!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:40.121
But Miss Sanae still hasn't...

00:19:40.145 --> 00:19:41.738
It's okay.

00:19:42.414 --> 00:19:44.259
| told you, didn't 1?

00:19:44.283 --> 00:19:46.251
She isn't going to come.

00:19:46.818 --> 00:19:49.287
No, Mister! You can't, datchu!

00:19:49.788 --> 00:19:51.552
If she's not coming,
go get her, datchu!

00:19:52.524 --> 00:19:56.638
Apologize and ask her to let you
start over again, datchu!

00:19:56.662 --> 00:20:00.108
Miss Sanae has got to be actually
waiting for you, too, Mister!

00:20:00.132 --> 00:20:01.943
I'm sure of it!

00:20:01.967 --> 00:20:03.044
For me?

00:20:03.068 --> 00:20:07.315
Yeah! She's gotta be wishing it
could be like old times again!

00:20:07.339 --> 00:20:09.284
You are too, aren't you?!

00:20:09.308 --> 00:20:11.452
You can just start over
again now, datchu!

00:20:11.476 --> 00:20:14.255
The three of you as a family!
It's not too late!

00:20:14.279 --> 00:20:18.026
Mister, you said that you should keep
promises just now, remember?!

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:20.485
So, please don't give up!

00:20:22.688 --> 00:20:24.383
Sayo...

00:20:24.823 --> 00:20:26.723
You're right.

00:20:27.292 --> 00:20:30.318
I'm sorry, you're exactly right, Sayo.

00:20:31.196 --> 00:20:32.207
Mister!

00:20:32.231 --> 00:20:36.725
| would be a failure as a father if
| could not trust my own daughter.

00:20:37.302 --> 00:20:39.771
| will go visit my wife's home now.

00:20:40.973 --> 00:20:44.432
There's probably a good reason why
Miss Sanae couldn't make it!

00:20:45.611 --> 00:20:47.255
Oh, I know!

00:20:47.279 --> 00:20:48.747
This is for Miss Sanae!

00:20:49.715 --> 00:20:52.810
A present from Sayo. I'll bet
it'll look good on her.

00:20:53.452 --> 00:20:55.697
Thank you, Sayo.

00:20:55.721 --> 00:20:57.999
No, well...

00:20:58.023 --> 00:20:59.718
Officer Kotobuki...

00:21:00.359 --> 00:21:04.305
Mr. Yamada, for your sake,
as well as your daughter's,

00:21:04.329 --> 00:21:06.297
please don't do anything
stupid like that again.

00:21:07.633 --> 00:21:09.397
Thank you so very much!

00:21:09.801 --> 00:21:13.328
Man, it's like I'm the only one
that's not needed here.

00:21:25.183 --> 00:21:27.550
Sanae...

00:21:28.787 --> 00:21:30.186
<i>Sanae!</i>

00:21:45.971 --> 00:21:47.081
I'm so glad.

00:21:47.105 --> 00:21:49.817
Detective Kotobuki, I guess
that's case closed.

00:21:49.841 --> 00:21:53.254
Yeah, Detective Masato!
Mission accomplished, datchu!

00:21:53.278 --> 00:21:54.188
Roger!

00:21:54.212 --> 00:21:55.737
Oh, yeah!

00:21:56.148 --> 00:21:57.358
Ta-da!

00:21:57.382 --> 00:21:59.427
What's this, datchu?

00:21:59.451 --> 00:22:00.595
It's a little early,

00:22:00.619 --> 00:22:03.782
but it's a first anniversary button for
being boyfriend and girlfriend!

00:22:04.056 --> 00:22:06.184
Well? Don't you think
it's pretty neat?

00:22:08.694 --> 00:22:11.139
Masato, I love you, love you,
love you so much!

00:22:11.163 --> 00:22:13.131
Me tool

00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:15.076
| love you!

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:16.226
Oh, my.

00:22:16.601 --> 00:22:18.365
What a social studies
field trip that was.

00:22:18.804 --> 00:22:20.795
Sheesh, talk about showing off.

00:22:26.912 --> 00:22:29.279
Late! Too late!

00:22:29.915 --> 00:22:32.460
It's dinner time and no one's
come home yet?!

00:22:32.484 --> 00:22:35.146
What is the problem with
this family, datchu?!

00:22:35.921 --> 00:22:41.917
Daikirai anata itsumo waratte ite

00:22:42.294 --> 00:22:48.131
Tsuyokute kawaikute ninki-mono de

00:22:48.567 --> 00:22:54.916
Daikirai watashi guzu de noroma de

00:22:54.940 --> 00:23:00.208
Dare ni mo hitsuyou to saretenai...

00:23:01.179 --> 00:23:07.462
Atama mo yokute itsumo suki ga nakute

00:23:07.486 --> 00:23:13.255
Watashi nado kitto baka ni sareteru

00:23:13.825 --> 00:23:20.141
Hontou wa hanashi-kakete-mitakute

00:23:20.165 --> 00:23:25.847
Tomodachi ni naritai to omottete

00:23:25.871 --> 00:23:31.833
Urayamashiku omotteta anata ga

00:23:32.210 --> 00:23:37.792
Hitori kata furuwasete naite ita yo

00:23:37.816 --> 00:23:45.333
Nei anata mo hitori obieteru no?

00:23:45.357 --> 00:23:51.272
Minna mijime de yowai no kana

00:23:51.296 --> 00:23:57.979
Motto yuuki ga atta nara

00:23:58.003 --> 00:24:04.375
Watashi anata dakishimeteta

00:24:05.343 --> 00:24:07.722
Next Super GALS!

00:24:07.746 --> 00:24:10.191
Next Super GALS! From Machida, infinitely
close to Kanagawa on the west end of Tokyo,

00:24:10.215 --> 00:24:13.561
comes a funny guy, infinitely
close to being a monkey!

00:24:13.585 --> 00:24:15.096
His face is a monkey,
his soul is a monkey,

00:24:15.120 --> 00:24:16.697
and after debuting in Shibuya,
he's a huge hit!

00:24:16.721 --> 00:24:19.333
His name is Tatsuki Kuroi.
His talent is in para-para.

00:24:19.357 --> 00:24:21.135
He says he's the king of para-para in Machida.

00:24:21.159 --> 00:24:24.493
His nickname is Machida West High's
Black. Machida Black for short!

00:24:25.030 --> 00:24:27.074
What is he, the bad guy from a kid's show?

00:24:27.098 --> 00:24:27.475
Next time on Super Gals Ran Kotobuki,

